<section class="prose">
    <h2>How this site is built</h2>
    <p>
        Every page you're reading was generated at build time by
        <a href="https://www.11ty.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Eleventy</a>,
        a zero-config static site generator. Markdown posts under
        <code>src/posts/</code> get compiled into clean HTML, then the whole
        <code>dist/</code> folder gets uploaded to Arweave through the free
        <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@ardrive/turbo-sdk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Turbo SDK</a>
        with a path manifest so that routes like <code>/blog/</code>,
        <code>/about/</code>, and individual post URLs all resolve from a
        single manifest transaction.
    </p>

    <h2>Tech stack</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Eleventy</strong> -- static site generator</li>
        <li><strong>Nunjucks + Markdown</strong> -- templating &amp; content</li>
        <li><strong>Plain CSS</strong> -- custom dark theme, no frameworks</li>
        <li><strong>Arweave + Turbo SDK</strong> -- permanent hosting</li>
    </ul>

